<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/s/platform">Platform</a></li><li><a href="/r/acme-infra?s=platform">Infra</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Request access rights</span></li></ol></nav>
<p class="meta"><span class="kind">Guide</span></p>
<h1>Request access rights</h1>
<p class="summary">Get time-limited admin rights for a cloud account, with a reason.</p>
<div class="prose">
<ol>
<li>Open <a class="link-ref" href="https://access.acme.example" data-show="/s/platform#acme-infra/access-portal">the access portal</a>.</li>
<li>Pick the role and give a reason.</li>
<li>The rights end on their own after four hours.</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="roles-per-environment">Roles per environment <a class="anchor" href="#roles-per-environment" aria-label="Link to this section">🔗</a></h2><div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Table"><table><thead><tr><th>Environment</th><th>Role</th><th>Approver</th><th>Portal</th><th>Lasts</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Production</td><td><code>admin-production-eu-west</code></td><td>Platform on-call</td><td><code>access.acme.example/production</code></td><td>4 hours</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staging</td><td><code>admin-staging-eu-west</code></td><td>Any platform engineer</td><td><code>access.acme.example/staging</code></td><td>8 hours</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div><h2 id="what-it-does-not-do">What it does not do <a class="anchor" href="#what-it-does-not-do" aria-label="Link to this section">🔗</a></h2>
<p>It never grants rights to other people. See
<a href="/e/acme-infra/access-model?s=platform#what-it-is-not">the access model</a>.</p>
</div>
